Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holdin' on your rope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me ten feet off the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm hearin' what you say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just can't make a sound, no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me that you need me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you go and cut me down, but wait
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me that you're sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think I'd turn around and say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's too late to apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:01:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's too late to apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late
